<h3 class=3D"text-lg font-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-1.5">=F0=9F=94=AE The=
 Future We're Building</h3>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">WebAssembly represents more than=
 a performance optimization - it's an <strong>architectural shift</strong> =
toward true polyglot web development. Trong 5 years, ch=C3=BAng ta s=E1=BA=
=BD look back at current performance limitations nh=C6=B0 ch=C3=BAng ta now=
 look back at dial-up internet: "How did we ever accept that as normal?"</p=
>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>The Compound Innovation =
Effect:</strong></p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">When you combine WebAssembly v=
=E1=BB=9Bi emerging technologies:</p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>WebGPU</strong>: Parall=
el compute on graphics hardware</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>WebXR</strong>: Immersi=
ve experiences requiring real-time performance</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Edge Computing</strong>=
: Serverless functions running native code</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>AI/ML</strong>: Client-=
side inference v=E1=BB=9Bi production-grade models</li>
</ul>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">You get <strong>exponential poss=
ibilities</strong>, kh=C3=B4ng ch=E1=BB=89 incremental improvements.</p>
