sing Thoughts: Beyond the Hype</h3>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">After shipping WebAssembly-power=
ed features to millions of users across multiple organizations, t=C3=B4i c=
=C3=B3 th=E1=BB=83 confidently say: <strong>WebAssembly delivers on its pro=
mises</strong>, nh=C6=B0ng nh=C6=B0 m=E1=BB=8Di powerful technology, succes=
s depends on thoughtful application.</p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>The WebAssembly mindset =
isn't about replacing JavaScript</strong> - it's about <strong>architectura=
l sophistication</strong>. It's the recognition r=E1=BA=B1ng different prob=
lems require different tools, v=C3=A0 the wisdom to choose the right tool f=
or each job.</p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Your users don't care whether yo=
u use JavaScript, WebAssembly, ho=E1=BA=B7c quantum computing. They care ab=
out applications that are <strong>fast</strong>, <strong>reliable</strong>,=
 v=C3=A0 <strong>delightful</strong> to use. WebAssembly is simply one of t=
he most powerful tools available today to deliver that experience.</p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Start small. Think big. =
Ship value.</strong></p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">The future of high-performance w=
eb applications is being written today, v=C3=A0 WebAssembly is one of the m=
ost important chapters trong that story.</p>
